    "text": "NBCMontana\nwebsite\nSheridan\nMadison Co. running 3-day water cleaning cycle\nBy NBC Montana Staff,\n3 hours agoSHERIDAN, Mont. — In Sheridan, officials say they are running a 72-hour cleaning cycle, and after that process is finished, officials will collect water samples from across the city. The results are expected by Wednesday and will determine whether the system can return to everyday use. Until then, officials...",
